    english: Street-Side Invitation
    korean: "\uAC70\uB9AC\uC758 \uCD08\uB300"
  - key: item.ability_attention_call.description
    english: Increase the chance of attracting passing guests by {VisitorChance}
      percentage points per level, up to 100%.
    korean: "\uB808\uBCA8\uB2F9 \uC678\uACFD \uC190\uB2D8\uC758 \uAD00\uC2EC\uC744
      \uB04C \uD655\uB960 +{VisitorChance}%p. \uCD5C\uB300 \uD655\uB960\uC740 100%\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4."
  - key: hex.help.Walls
    english: "Select an owned tile. Green + builds; red \u2212 removes a wall."
